  "implemented_scope": [
    "Bounded editable curved/holed Union with native async transaction/undo, source/reference refusals, raw tombstone reservations, topmost save/reopen stacking and actual pixel checks. Text/data/master/glue operands refused; first document-order appearance and selected-result policies remain local, not exact-build parity.",
    "Owned immutable PDF preparation and foreground-page range/all printing on one common paper size. Explicit requested scale is applied once in PDF playback, then native scale1; page/margin clipping and unsupported effective options refuse before spooling. Native save-to-PDF checks are local; tiling/device media/calibrated printer qualification remain open.",
    "Source-preserving VSSX Save As draft with rename, same-package duplication, order, safe deletion and exact existing literal values; stable public IDs/NameU/GUIDs/resources, native undo/cancel/stale/close ownership. Deletion proof is deliberately closed and conservative. Formula/visual editing, cross-library closure and reference qualification remain open.",
    "Native File menu retains/reuses custom stencil windows and coordinates dirty/busy Close/Quit without losing drafts; closed controllers clear undo callbacks, package snapshots and retained seams.",
    "Command search dispatches Union and Print, tracks print preparation/publication availability independently of drawing revision and refuses reentrant Print while the native publication phase is active.",
    "Union known No Style Enable*Props defaults are accepted only as literal 1 with empty formula/unit; authored variants, unknown cells/namespace owners/parts/relationships and incoming semantic references remain refused.",
    "Native print evidence retains actual prepared/native PDFs plus settings/hash manifests. Tests measure the 1m at1:50 marker at20mm/100% and10mm/50% with local raster tolerance0.3mm; this does not meet or claim calibrated physical-printer tolerance0.2mm."
  ],
